# The security key's lease (fix round 11): every key check, the daemon's
# unit's or the PAM module's while faceauthd is down, holds an exclusive
# flock on this file from before it asks the key until it exits, so two
# never run at once, across a restart of the daemon too. Outside
# /run/faceauth, which the daemon's restarts keep but its stops remove;
# root's alone, so no one else can hold it and keep every check off the key.
# Installed as /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/faceauth.conf.
f /run/faceauth-key.lease 0600 root root -
